{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 对人物动机的解释和段落之间的因果铺垫不如 Y 完整，尤其 S08 到 S09、S13 到 S14，Y 更容易让人理解情绪为什么发生转变。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的短句、重点高亮和感受字的轻重层次，让观众更容易在听音乐时迅速抓住每段主旨；按音乐时刻出现的感受词，也能提供更细致的听觉对应，不只是堆砌情绪形容词。Y 的人物心理解释和前后衔接更完整，但左侧长句在短时间内需要投入更多阅读注意力，而且部分音乐变化被概括掉了。综合普通观众边听边扫的体验，我更倾向 X，虽然它确实需要改善叙事过渡。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "89274777-eefd-48dd-9eb5-91c071bc7433", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T070900497669Z", "elapsed_seconds": 202.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:12:23.004720+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3ef000c0ad4623eceba91dcca5113a8bcba4c37d9a238b6914b215670f7c1625", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g